MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This is the same if you use dplyr:
women %>%
    ggplot(mapping = aes(x = height, y = weight)) + geom_point() + geom_vline(xintercept = summarize(mean(height)))

