If you had provided a reproducible example it would be easier to provide code that might help, but you can consider using geom_hline(yintercept = 0) and geom_vline(xintercept = 0) with some modification of linetype and colour of line as you like. See ?geom_hline. You can remove the existing gridlines with p + theme(panel.grid = element_blank()).

Olivia

